<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: auto; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 8px;">
  <h2 style="color: #f5a623;">⚡ BIDYUT</h2>
  <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
  <p>Use this one-time password to continue. It expires in <strong>10 minutes</strong>.</p>
  <div style="font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: 8px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin: 24px 0; color: #111;">
    <%= otp %>
  </div>
  <p style="color: #999; font-size: 12px;">If you did not request this code, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
</div>